Purpose
-------
The earlier selected-site prefix captured only 16,384 samples from the start
of the run. This pair used stride 512 with the schema-v7 execution-observation
sidecar, covering the selected delay_tsc RIP across almost the entire
3,000,000,000-retired-instruction budget. The run is diagnostic only.

